---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import ArchimedesRig from '../ArchimedesRig.astro';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[2];
---

<section 
  id="scene-3" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="archimedes" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.piApproximation}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Narrative beats -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">03 // SIRACUSA, 250 a.C.</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Arquímedes se dio cuenta de que no podía medir la curva directamente. Así que construyó una trampa matemática: dos polígonos regulares que encierran al círculo desde dentro y desde fuera.'
            : 'Archimedes realized he could not measure the curve directly. So he devised a mathematical trap: two regular polygons boxing in the circle from within and without.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.95">
        <span class="scene-kicker">03 // EL MÉTODO DEL AGOTAMIENTO</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">Duplicación al Límite: 96 Lados</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Duplicó los lados cuatro veces sucesivas: 6 → 12 → 24 → 48 → 96 lados. Al llegar a 96 lados, la brecha se redujo a menos de 0.002. π quedó irreversiblemente acorralado entre 223/71 y 22/7.'
            : 'He doubled the sides four times successively: 6 → 12 → 24 → 48 → 96 sides. At 96 sides, the margin narrowed under 0.002. π was irreversibly cornered between 223/71 and 22/7.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Archimedes Interactive Rig -->
    <div class="rig-wrapper">
      <ArchimedesRig />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #151821 0%, #090a0e 100%);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .narrative {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10vh;
    max-width: 680px;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .beat {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 16px, 0);
    transition: opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
  }

  .beat.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #ff9d00;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.05rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rig-wrapper {
    margin-top: 15vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
  }
</style>
